WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.870
Sai Saici! Sai Saici!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.000
Sai Saici!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.670
Hey! You expect to sleep all day?

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.000
You haven't begun
your morning training!

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.590
If you won't rise...

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.840
Like it or not...

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.130
...we'll make you get up!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:00.130
What?!

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.850
When did he escape?!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.060
And where?!

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:10.650
I know my match against
Bro's coming up...

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.190
...but why get so uptight about it?

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.030
You just have to remain calm.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.230
Yeah, remain calm.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.540
Oh, no. Z uisen and Keiun's things.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.140
Hey, what's this?

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.040
A letter from my father?

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.990
To Z uisen and Keiun?

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.300
Th-this is...!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.890
Now, everyone.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.640
What is written in this letter...

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.850
...that Sai Saici stumbled upon?

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:51.600
And...

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.980
...who would think that this letter...

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.900
...would turn the Fight
between Domon and Sai Saici...

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:01.610
Neo China Neo Japan
Dragon Gundam vs. God Gundam

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.780
...plotted by Wong...

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.570
...into something truly spectacular?

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.410
And now!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:07.620
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:13.670
Sai Saici's New Attack!
Blazing Dragon Gundam

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.220
What a total surprise!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.480
Indeed!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.940
This fighting spirit is so
unbecoming of that sleepyhead.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.940
He's like a different person.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.520
However...

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.320
...there's something
I don't like about it.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.900
What's there not to like?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.450
Don't you find
this change too drastic?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.450
Well...

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.550
What could've happened to him...

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.180
...to have his attitude change
so drastically like that?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.680
That's what's bothering me.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.650
I see this change as
something positive.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.760
Bro...

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.630
Rain.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.590
Allenby.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:44.420
Let's take a break.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.430
Find out anything?!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.140
Nothing.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.510
The whole Neo Japan
consulate is searching...

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.520
...but no clues yet.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.850
You're talking about that
Devil Gundam, right?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:56.940
Yeah.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.980
There's no mistake.
It's hiding somewhere in this city.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.900
Thanks for sparring
with him every day.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.710
Your crew doesn't mind?

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.860
Not at all!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.910
They've given up on that.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.490
Hey!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.740
I hear your next opponent,
Sai Saici...

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.830
...is pretty strong for his size.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.500
That's right.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.120
He can't be underestimated.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.460
Well...

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.540
...I'm heading back to the junk.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.380
Mustn't spoil your training, right?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.170
Huh?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.840
What's she upset about?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.390
That attitude will make her old.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.260
Hey, Bro!

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.390
Sai Saici!

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.600
Hi!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.310
I can't stop!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.780
Perfect landing.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.550
There we go!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.720
Awesome.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.600
Gundam Fighters can do
stuff like this, too?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.400
I'm not here asking you to go
easy on me during the match.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.400
Then why did you come?

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.110
How should I put it?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.820
It's a gesture of respect
to the enemy.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.990
I want you well fed...

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.660
...so you're in top shape
for the match.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.450
Thanks.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.370
I shall value this meal.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.540
Hey, don't get so serious.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.630
I won't go easy on you either.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.590
No hard feelings, whomever wins.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:47.940
We'll worry about the
Devil Gundam later.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.730
Well, doesn't this look delicious!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:05.900
Now dig in, everyone!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.070
Because I sure will!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.440
You sure are a character.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.700
Well, look who's talking.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.200
Hey, Domon.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.280
Mind if I have a go with this boy?

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.290
It's not really my style to
pick a fight...

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.330
...with girls who're
still in their diapers.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.840
Wait 'til you're done eating.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.000
But I wouldn't want to
turn my back to you.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.920
Look who's talking.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.090
You're the one with a mark
on your butt.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.140
All right!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.680
I'm going to fight you!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.190
What's that?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.320
They're both children!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:58.240
Fighters all act like children.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.080
But it's incredible!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.700
Let's go watch them!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.620
No thanks!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.130
But this really is a great fight.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:10.840
You're pretty good.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.050
You too!

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.810
You...

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.360
I've no choice!

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:30.530
What?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.190
Huh?

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:35.740
That was...

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.200
H-hey! What's the matter?

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:41.680
Guess I lose!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.540
You didn't fight your best!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.290
I did!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.880
Can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.840
See?

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.630
Right.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.180
Then let's have some of that
food you made.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.220
Let's go. Before it gets cold.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>This news just in</i>.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.190
<i>Neo China's imperial delegation</i>
<i>has arrived at the Keitoku Airport</i>.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.400
<i>The purpose of the visit</i>...

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.690
...<i>is to observe tomorrow's</i>
<i>Gundam Fight</i>...

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:14.240
...<i>between Neo China</i>
<i>and Neo Japan</i>.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.070
<i>They will also ex change views</i>
<i>with leaders of other nations</i>...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.070
<i>They will also ex change views</i>
<i>with leaders of other nations</i>...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.070
- I better get back.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.950
Sorry, but I have to go.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.490
Say "bye" to Bro for me.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.000
I'll see him in the ring.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.200
W-wait!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.730
Oh, yeah?

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.800
He'll see me in the ring, huh?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.050
That kid's something.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.580
If he fights seriously,
you could be in trouble.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.340
I know.

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.600
He's willing to fight to the death.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.020
He came to say goodbye to me.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.620
Make way for the Emperor!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.010
Lmperial Majesty...

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:34.570
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.490
Sai Saici...

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.410
You have impressed me
with your Gundam Fight record.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.830
Your achievements have
glorified the Neo China name.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.730
Your success shall be rewarded.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.620
Thank you very much.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.080
Z uisen! Keiun!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.920
Your hard work has been
worthwhile, hasn't it?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.800
Your kind words are appreciated.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.170
So, Sai Saici...

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.090
...is there anything you wish for?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.510
Yes.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.470
There is one wish I have.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.100
Tell me what it is.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.980
The revival of the Shaolin Temple.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.310
Revival of the Shaolin Temple?!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.360
Not right at this moment.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.900
But when I win the Gundam
Fight Championship.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.280
With those words, you will
have to become champion.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.490
I stake my life on it.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.520
I have heard your request.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.950
I shall consider it.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.210
Thank you very much!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:40.880
Sai Saici.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.470
You spoke well.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:43.790
I'm proud of you.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.350
Proud of what?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:49.560
Why, appealing for the revival
of the Shaolin Temple.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.150
We never realized that you had
been giving it so much thought.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:55.980
I just...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.030
...realized how juvenile I am.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.490
You hear that, Z uisen?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.830
He's one who realizes
how juvenile he is.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.290
Wondrous moon...

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.540
...please lend me your strength.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.420
I will do my best to
revive the Shaolin Temple.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.890
Tomorrow's my decisive
match with Sai Saici.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.270
Come to think of it...

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:36.650
...he's one strange character.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.440
I'm his enemy,
but he calls me "Bro."

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.760
And he's always with me.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:45.570
Also...

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.820
...I'll never forget the
first time we fought.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.360
That moment I thought I had
won the match.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:59.170
At the same time, he was ready
to take my Gundam's head.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:04.590
Sai Saici was the only one to ever
force me to settle for a draw.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:08.140
And now he stakes his life
on our upcoming match!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.420
I swear that I, too, will fight
the best that I can!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.510
Sai Saici...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.990
...we will see you off here.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.100
We will remain here and...

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.970
...pray deeply for your victory.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.730
You must fight as your heart desires.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.020
Keiun, Z uisen...

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.060
Thank you.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.230
I will go now.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.990
<i>The moment has arrived</i>.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.030
<i>We're in the late stages</i>
<i>of the Final Rounds</i>.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>What we have today is</i>...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.830
...<i>the match between God</i>
<i>Gundam and Dragon Gundam!</i>

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.790
<i>Both Gundams have</i>
<i>survived some severe battles</i>.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:21.750
<i>Which one will victory</i>
<i>smile upon?</i>

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.590
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.420
Ready!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.800
Go!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.970
They're equally matched.

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:39.100
It wouldn't be surprising
if either won.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.350
Then perhaps today...

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:44.320
...we'll see your favorite pupil
crumble in defeat, Master.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.530
What're you...!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.950
Forgive me if I said something
detrimental to your health.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.420
Say goodbye!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:14.970
That goes for you!

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.140
Take this!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.520
Kanjizai Bosatsu!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:28.650
Gyojin Hannya Haramittaji!

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.700
Shoken Go-onkaikuu!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:35.410
Doissai Kuyaku Sharishi!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.910
Shikifu lku!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:41.000
Kuufuishiki Shikisoku Z ekuu!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.250
- Kuusoku Z eshiki Jusogyoshiki!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.170
- Domon!
- Kuusoku Z eshiki Jusogyoshiki!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.420
- Gotcha!
- Kuusoku Z eshiki Jusogyoshiki!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.380
Not so fast, Sai Saici!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.260
We pray that our Sai Saici
will be...

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.560
...victorious in this match!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.060
I won't let this...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.430
...beat me!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.850
Sai Saici!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.730
Take this!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.280
Muei Kyaku!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.990
Come on now, Domon!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.410
That kid's really something.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.080
He just might win this match.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.500
This is it!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.750
Think again!

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.140
Why, that's...!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.390
<i>This is becoming a</i>
<i>one-sided match</i>.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.520
<i>God Gundam is in total control</i>.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.520
Keiun! I got it!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.230
I understand it now!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.190
This is it!
This is the reason!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.410
The will written by
Sai Saici's father!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.160
Are you suggesting he read this?

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:58.700
Yes.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.870
I was keeping it from him
until he reached adulthood.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.920
<i>Zuisen, Keiun</i>...

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.130
<i>It has been a long time since</i>
<i>I embarked on my journey</i>...

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.670
...<i>in the hope of achieving</i>
<i>our dream of many years</i>.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.460
<i>However</i>...

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:17.140
...<i>my days are numbered</i>.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:20.890
<i>We will not be able to revive</i>
<i>the Shaolin Temple</i>.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:22.060
<i>Yes</i>.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.930
<i>The regret of having to leave</i>
<i>this world</i>...

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:27.230
...<i>without fulfilling my ambition</i>
<i>because of an illness</i>...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.300
...<i>is utterly heartbreaking</i>.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:35.360
<i>However, my biggest regret</i>
<i>has to do with my son, Sai Saici</i>.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:39.240
<i>If I may be so bold as to</i>
<i>make this request</i>...

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:43.040
...<i>I would appreciate it if you,</i>
<i>Zuisen and Keiun</i>...

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.370
...<i>would guide my son</i>
<i>to succeed in my mission</i>.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.930
I cannot afford to lose.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.930
You're totally amazing.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:05.890
I was still a child, so I can't
remember my father's face.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.230
But I can clearly see
my father chasing his dream.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.940
Therefore, I promise!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.280
I promise I'll revive
the Shaolin Temple!

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:23.410
Sai Saici!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.120
Father!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.920
Father!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.260
My son!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.050
Don't give up until the end!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.550
I will guide you!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.560
What?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.200
Chikulin in the Heavens!
Shaolin on Earth!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.620
I will show you!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.000
My ultimate technique!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.840
The most advanced
of Shaolin techniques...

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.130
...thought to have vanished
long ago!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:23.680
However, the technique also
happens to cost one's life!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.270
Shin Ryusei Kochoken!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.890
Sai Saici!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.520
Y-you've done it!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.020
Then, I must...!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.370
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:46.070
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.690
Erupting...

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.670
...God Finger!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.260
The God Finger!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.090
I win! I've won!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.380
No, I'm not done yet!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.890
God Finger with the left hand?!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.520
I won't lose...

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.150
I cannot lose...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.280
I'll perish before I lose.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.970
Not yet...

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.750
...Domon Kasshu!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:33.750
Then...

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.880
...I'll make things easy!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:42.820
Heat End!

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:43.840
That's enough!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.350
Sai Saici!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.310
M-my Emperor...

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.270
Sai Saici...

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.770
You are indeed the
pride of Neo China!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.150
I cannot afford
to have you perish!

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.740
My Emperor...

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:08.120
Your feelings about reviving
the Shaolin Temple...

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.450
...I now understand.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:12.290
Win the Battle Royale!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.190
I will grant your wish!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.240
Thank you very much.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.710
Sai Saici.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.260
That was a great Fight.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.100
You did well.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.770
I'm sure your father
would be extremely happy.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.460
Why's everyone putting on a show?!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.490
Will someone defeat Domon?!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:47.410
What's so funny?!

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.080
It's odd of you to sponsor
this Gundam Fight...

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:55.200
...yet not understand the
heart of the martial artist!

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.250
Look...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.500
...and learn a thing about
the true martial artist!

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:04.960
People who communicate
with their fists.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.590
I think I'm beginning
to understand it a little.

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:27.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.320 --> 00:22:29.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.660
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:42.790
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:46.460
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:53.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.430 --> 00:23:00.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:05.270
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:25.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.720
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:35.100
Argo challenges Domon
with the Gaia Crusher...

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:37.810
...his new ultimate technique!

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:41.230
Meanwhile, Graham, who has
vowed revenge against Argo...

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:43.270
...watches over carefully.

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:45.270
But, behind the scenes...

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:49.070
...Wong is going ahead
with his terrifying plan!

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:51.820
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.830
Domon vs. Argo!
Charging Bolt Gundam

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:59.630
Domon vs. Argo!
Charging Bolt Gundam

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.740
Ready! Go!
